  "description": "SDK for ECM Client & Server development using OPC UA. The OPC UA Extrusion - Compounding and Mixing (ECM) Companion Specification defines a standardized information model for extrusion processes, specifically focusing on compounding and mixing equipment. It enables seamless integration of extrusion machinery into OPC UA environments, allowing for consistent representation of machine states, process parameters, and production data. This facilitates interoperability between equipment, control systems, and enterprise applications, supporting advanced monitoring, process optimization, and efficient data exchange in the plastics and rubber industries.",
